      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Had to stop here if you find this @taka.\nHoping to be back on later tonight\notherwise tomorrow morning will finish this\noff. Was going to have an Agent section\nthat describes in more detail how each\nagent works and its system prompts /\navailable tools.",
      "fontSize": 223.42857142857164,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Had to stop here if you find this @taka. Hoping to be back on later tonight otherwise tomorrow morning will finish this off. Was going to have an Agent section that describes in more detail how each agent works and its system prompts / available tools.",
