      "created": 1792286024785,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The key event ledger is the authoritative\nrecord of key events. If it conflicts with\nanything in the match context, trust the\nledger. If this narrative step was triggered\nby a key event, the triggering event will be in\nthe raw events and should be the focus of\nyour excerpt.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The key event ledger is the authoritative record of key events. If it conflicts with anything in the match context, trust the ledger. If this narrative step was triggered by a key event, the triggering event will be in the raw events and should be the focus of your excerpt.",
